WEBVTT

00:12:57.831 --> 00:13:02.912
three major areas have been identified
as a way of moving into the future.

00:13:02.912 --> 00:13:06.629
One which is really in ICT, in computing,

00:13:06.629 --> 00:13:10.508
in AI, in cybersecurity, 
in Arabic language processing,

00:13:10.508 --> 00:13:12.272
in social networks.

00:13:12.272 --> 00:13:16.112
Second area is related 
to energy and environment.

00:13:16.112 --> 00:13:20.312
We all know the challenge 
that is facing not only the region,

00:13:20.312 --> 00:13:24.895
but internationally, 
from climate change, air quality, water,

00:13:24.895 --> 00:13:27.523
and a lot of people speaking 
about the future:

00:13:28.903 --> 00:13:31.763
dispute is going to be
around water, energy